Miot Vacuum Map

The frontend includes code adapted from Mushroom by Paul Bottein and contributors,
and Home Assistant frontend helpers by the Home Assistant contributors.
Mushroom: https://github.com/piitaya/lovelace-mushroom
Home Assistant: https://github.com/home-assistant/frontend

The backend includes code adapted from Xiaomi Miot by al-one and contributors.
Xiaomi Miot: https://github.com/al-one/hass-xiaomi-miot

These projects are distributed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
Adaptations provide vacuum map rendering, a dedicated WebSocket API, independent
custom elements, and the shared controls required by the vacuum card.

